|---|---:|
| **Chosen score ({{ m.outlier_score.selected_score | replace('_', ' ') }})** | **{{ m.outlier_score.lift | lift }}** (95% CI {{ m.outlier_score.lift_ci95[0] | lift }}-{{ m.outlier_score.lift_ci95[1] | lift }}) |
| Peer-adjusted, equal weights | {{ m.outlier_score.equal_weights_lift | lift }} |
